{"id": "c01e3915-ee93-49e8-b5f1-167d6ee42f3a", "slug": "axiom-observability-matrix", "title": "Axiom — Observability Matrix", "description": "Axiom Observability Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Axiom — Observability Matrix\"\ndescription: \"Axiom Observability Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFB454\"\n  secondary: \"#0C0A07\"\n  accent: \"#FF6B5B\"\n  background: \"#0C0A07\"\n  surface: \"#F2EDE2\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#5C564A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Martian Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Atkinson Hyperlegible\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Martian Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Axiom — Observability Matrix\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 3; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, charts, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nAxiom Observability Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nAxiom Architecture Data Streams Integrations Reference Initialize SYS_VER 2.1 / ACTIVE CLUSTER-09 Observe the complex. Master the infrastructure. An interactive observability matrix mapping microservices in real-time. D…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Observe the complex. Master the infrastructure.; Node Mapping; Stream Analytics; Auto-Remediation.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFB454, secondary #0C0A07, accent #FF6B5B, background #0C0A07, surface #F2EDE2, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Martian Mono for display moments and Atkinson Hyperlegible for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Martian Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Axiom — Observability Matrix</title>\n\n<!-- Type system: Martian Mono (display + instrument) · Atkinson Hyperlegible (body) -->\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Martian+Mono:wdth,wght@75..112.5,100..800&family=Atkinson+Hyperlegible:wght@400;700&display=swap\">\n\n<style>\n  /* ============ Design tokens — amber phosphor console ============ */\n  :root{\n    --ink:      #0C0A07;            /* warm CRT black                  */\n    --ink-2:    #14110B;            /* panel base                      */\n    --paper:    #F2EDE2;            /* warm off-white text             */\n    --dim:      #9C937F;            /* secondary text                  */\n    --faint:    #5C564A;            /* tertiary / meta                 */\n    --phos:     #FFB454;            /* amber phosphor                  */\n    --phos-hi:  #FFD9A0;            /* hot phosphor core               */\n    --alert:    #FF6B5B;            /* anomaly coral                   */\n    --ok:       #B8E0C2;            /* healthy mint (sparing)          */\n    --hairline: rgba(242,237,226,.09);\n    --mono:     'Martian Mono', monospace;\n    --body:     'Atkinson Hyperlegible', sans-serif;\n    --ease:     cubic-bezier(.19, 1, .22, 1);\n  }\n\n  *{ margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  body{\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    font-family: var(--body);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n  ::selection{ background: rgba(255,180,84,.28); color: var(--paper); }\n  a{ color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n  button{ font: inherit; color: inherit; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }\n  :focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid var(--phos); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 2px; }\n\n  /* ============ Scene layers ============ */\n  #net{ position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 0; }\n  .veil{\n    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(110% 90% at 22% 45%, rgba(12,10,7,.78) 0%, rgba(12,10,7,.15) 48%, rgba(12,10,7,0) 70%),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(12,10,7,.85) 0%, rgba(12,10,7,0) 18%),\n      linear-gradient(to top,    rgba(12,10,7,.85) 0%, rgba(12,10,7,0) 20%);\n  }\n  .scanlines{\n    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; opacity: .35;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,\n      rgba(0,0,0,0) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0) 2px, rgba(0,0,0,.16) 3px);\n  }\n  .glow-edge{\n    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 180px rgba(255,180,84,.045);\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Shell ============ */\n  .shell{\n    position: relative; z-index: 10;\n    max-width: 100rem; margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 clamp(1.5rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);\n    min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100svh;\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Header ============ */\n  header{\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 2rem 0 1.4rem;\n  }\n  .brand{\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem;\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: .95rem;\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n  }\n  .brand .gem{\n    width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--phos);\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255,180,84,.8);\n    animation: gem 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes gem{ 0%,100%{ opacity: 1; } 50%{ opacity: .55; } }\n  nav{ display: flex; gap: 2.3rem; }\n  nav a{\n    position: relative; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--dim);\n    transition: color .3s ease; padding: .25rem 0;\n  }\n  nav a::after{\n    content:\"\"; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; height: 1px; width: 100%;\n    background: var(--phos); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left;\n    transition: transform .35s var(--ease);\n  }\n  nav a:hover{ color: var(--paper); }\n  nav a:hover::after{ transform: scaleX(1); }\n  .console-link{\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .14em;\n    color: var(--dim); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);\n    padding: .55rem 1.05rem; border-radius: 999px;\n    transition: color .3s, border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n  }\n  .console-link:hover{\n    color: var(--phos); border-color: rgba(255,180,84,.4);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,180,84,.12);\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Main grid ============ */\n  main{\n    flex: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);\n    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center;\n    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 3rem) 0 clamp(2rem, 5vh, 3.5rem);\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Left column ============ */\n  .eyebrow{\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.1rem;\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .64rem; letter-spacing: .22em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim);\n  }\n  .chip{\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,180,84,.25); border-radius: 999px;\n    padding: .5rem .95rem; color: var(--phos);\n    background: rgba(255,180,84,.04);\n  }\n  .chip .dot{\n    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--phos);\n    animation: blink 1.6s steps(2, start) infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes blink{ 50%{ opacity: .25; } }\n\n  h1{\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-variation-settings: \"wdth\" 80;\n    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5.4vw, 4.3rem);\n    line-height: 1.12;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n  }\n  h1 .ln{ display: block; white-space: nowrap; }\n  h1 .ln-dim{ font-weight: 240; color: var(--dim); }\n  h1 .ln-hot{ font-weight: 560; margin-top: .18em; }\n  h1 .accent{\n    background: linear-gradient(95deg, var(--phos-hi) 0%, var(--phos) 55%, var(--alert) 110%);\n    background-size: 200% 100%;\n    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; color: transparent;\n    animation: shimmer 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n  }\n  @keyframes shimmer{ from{ background-position: 0% 50%; } to{ background-position: 100% 50%; } }\n  .caret{\n    display: inline-block; width: .5em; height: 1em;\n    background: var(--phos); vertical-align: -0.12em; margin-left: .12em;\n    opacity: 0; animation: none;\n  }\n  .caret.on{ animation: caret 1.05s steps(2, start) infinite; }\n  @keyframes caret{ 0%,100%{ opacity: 1; } 50%{ opacity: 0; } }\n\n  .sub{\n    margin-top: 1.8rem; max-width: 30rem;\n    font-size: clamp(.95rem, 1.2vw, 1.05rem); color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n  .sub strong{ color: var(--paper); font-weight: 700; }\n\n  .ctas{ margin-top: 2.4rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }\n  .btn{\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem;\n    border-radius: 999px; padding: .92rem 1.7rem;\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: .1em;\n    transition: transform .35s var(--ease), box-shadow .35s, border-color .3s, color .3s, background .3s;\n  }\n  .btn-primary{\n    background: var(--phos); color: #161006;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px -8px rgba(255,180,84,.55);\n  }\n  .btn-primary:hover{\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 38px -8px rgba(255,180,84,.65);\n    background: var(--phos-hi);\n  }\n  .btn-ghost{\n    border: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--paper);\n  }\n  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color: rgba(255,180,84,.45); color: var(--phos); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n  .btn-ghost .pulse{\n    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--alert);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,91,.5); animation: ping 2.4s ease-out infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes ping{\n    0%{ box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,91,.45); }\n    70%{ box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(255,107,91,0); }\n    100%{ box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,91,0); }\n  }\n\n  /* Feature cards with HUD corner brackets */\n  .features{\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1rem; margin-top: 3.2rem; max-width: 42rem;\n  }\n  .card{\n    position: relative; padding: 1.15rem 1.1rem 1.2rem;\n    background: rgba(20,17,11,.55); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);\n    transition: transform .35s var(--ease), border-color .3s, background .3s;\n  }\n  .card::before, .card::after{\n    content:\"\"; position: absolute; width: 9px; height: 9px;\n    border-color: rgba(255,180,84,.55); border-style: solid;\n    transition: border-color .3s;\n  }\n  .card::before{ top: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 1px 0 0 1px; }\n  .card::after{ bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 0 1px 1px 0; }\n  .card:hover{ transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: rgba(255,180,84,.28); background: rgba(20,17,11,.8); }\n  .card:hover::before, .card:hover::after{ border-color: var(--phos); }\n  .card .tag{\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .2em;\n    color: var(--phos); display: block; margin-bottom: .8rem;\n  }\n  .card h3{ font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .01em; }\n  .card p{ font-size: .78rem; color: var(--dim); margin-top: .35rem; line-height: 1.5; }\n\n  /* ============ Right column: telemetry scope ============ */\n  .scope-wrap{ justify-self: end; width: 100%; max-width: 26rem; }\n  .scope{\n    position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(20,17,11,.85), rgba(12,10,7,.7));\n    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 1.8rem 1.8rem 1.6rem;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.8), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(242,237,226,.06);\n  }\n  .scope-head{\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .62rem; letter-spacing: .2em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\n  }\n  .sync{ display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; color: var(--phos); }\n  .sync .dot{\n    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--phos);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,180,84,.9); animation: blink 1.4s steps(2,start) infinite;\n  }\n\n  .ring-wrap{ position: relative; width: 13.5rem; height: 13.5rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .ring-wrap svg{ position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n  .ring-spin{ animation: spin 40s linear infinite; transform-origin: 50% 50%; }\n  @keyframes spin{ to{ transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n  .ring-center{\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;\n  }\n  .uptime{\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-variation-settings: \"wdth\" 85;\n    font-weight: 300; font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  }\n  .uptime small{ font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--faint); font-weight: 300; }\n  .ring-center .lbl{\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .6rem; letter-spacing: .26em;\n    color: var(--phos); margin-top: .55rem; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .ring-glow{\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,180,84,.13), transparent 62%);\n  }\n\n  #spark{ display: block; width: 100%; height: 52px; margin-top: 1.5rem; }\n  .spark-meta{\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .16em;\n    color: var(--faint); margin-top: .4rem; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .stats{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .9rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; }\n  .stat{\n    border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: .95rem 1rem; background: rgba(242,237,226,.02);\n    transition: border-color .3s, background .3s;\n  }\n  .stat:hover{ border-color: rgba(255,180,84,.25); background: rgba(255,180,84,.03); }\n  .stat .k{\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .56rem; letter-spacing: .18em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faint); display: block; margin-bottom: .45rem;\n  }\n  .stat .v{\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-variation-settings: \"wdth\" 85;\n    font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .stat .v small{ font-size: .85rem; color: var(--faint); margin-left: .2rem; }\n\n  .scope-foot{\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 1.2rem;\n    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .2em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faint);\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Entrance choreography ============ */\n  .reveal{ opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }\n  .loaded .reveal{\n    animation: rise .9s var(--ease) forwards;\n    animation-delay: var(--d, 0s);\n  }\n  @keyframes rise{ to{ opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n\n  /* ============ Responsive ============ */\n  @media (max-width: 1024px){\n    main{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }\n    .scope-wrap{ justify-self: start; }\n    h1 .ln{ white-space: normal; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 760px){\n    nav{ display: none; }\n    .features{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Reduced motion ============ */\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    *{ animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    .reveal{ opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n    .caret{ opacity: 1; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Live service graph — packets, dependencies, anomalies, remediation -->\n  <canvas id=\"net\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n  <div class=\"veil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"glow-edge\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"scanlines\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"shell\">\n\n    <header class=\"reveal\" style=\"--d:.05s\">\n      <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"gem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>AXIOM</div>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <a href=\"#\">Architecture</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Data streams</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Integrations</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Reference</a>\n      </nav>\n      <a class=\"console-link\" href=\"#\">OPEN CONSOLE</a>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n      <!-- Left: copy -->\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"eyebrow reveal\" style=\"--d:.2s\">\n          <span class=\"chip\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>SYS 2.1 — LIVE</span>\n          <span>CLUSTER-09 · 1,024 SERVICES</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <h1 aria-label=\"See every signal. Stop every cascade.\">\n          <span class=\"ln ln-dim\"><span class=\"decode\" data-text=\"See every signal.\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"ln ln-hot\"><span class=\"decode\" data-text=\"Stop every \"></span><span class=\"decode accent\" data-text=\"cascade.\"></span><span class=\"caret\" id=\"caret\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"sub reveal\" style=\"--d:.85s\">\n          Axiom maps every microservice and the traffic between them, <strong>live</strong>.\n          The graph behind this page is one: watch it detect an anomaly,\n          isolate the node, and heal the path — <strong>before the failure cascades</strong>.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"ctas reveal\" style=\"--d:1s\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#\">DEPLOY MATRIX</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>VIEW LIVE LOGS</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"features reveal\" style=\"--d:1.15s\">\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">MAP</span>\n            <h3>Node mapping</h3>\n            <p>Every service dependency auto-discovered and drawn as it changes.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">STRM</span>\n            <h3>Stream analytics</h3>\n            <p>High-fidelity latency and payload metrics on every edge.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">HEAL</span>\n            <h3>Auto-remediation</h3>\n            <p>Failing paths rerouted in milliseconds, no pager required.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right: telemetry scope -->\n      <div class=\"scope-wrap reveal\" style=\"--d:.6s\">\n        <div class=\"scope\">\n          <div class=\"scope-head\">\n            <span>Telemetry</span>\n            <span class=\"sync\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>syncing</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"ring-wrap\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"97\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(242,237,226,.06)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,180,84,.12)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <g id=\"ticks\" class=\"ring-spin\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></g>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"ring-glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ring-center\">\n              <span class=\"uptime\"><span id=\"uptime\">0.00</span><small>%</small></span>\n              <span class=\"lbl\">Uptime</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <canvas id=\"spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n          <div class=\"spark-meta\"><span>P99 latency</span><span>last 60 s</span></div>\n\n          <div class=\"stats\">\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <span class=\"k\">Active streams</span>\n              <span class=\"v\" id=\"streams\">1,024</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <span class=\"k\">Ping</span>\n              <span class=\"v\"><span id=\"ping\">8</span><small>ms</small></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scope-foot\">\n          <span>— matrix secured</span>\n          <span>chk.89</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n  /* ================================================================\n     LIVE SERVICE GRAPH — single 2D canvas, no libraries.\n     Nodes = services, packets travel the edges, an anomaly flares\n     coral every few seconds and a remediation ring heals it.\n  ================================================================ */\n  const cv  = document.getElementById('net');\n  const ctx = cv.getContext('2d');\n  const DPR = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1.5);\n  let W = 0, H = 0;\n\n  /* Pre-rendered glow sprites (cheap additive glow, no shadowBlur in loop) */\n  function makeGlow(color){\n    const s = document.createElement('canvas');\n    s.width = s.height = 64;\n    const g = s.getContext('2d');\n    const grad = g.createRadialGradient(32, 32, 0, 32, 32, 32);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, color);\n    grad.addColorStop(.35, color.replace('1)', '.35)'));\n    grad.addColorStop(1, color.replace('1)', '0)'));\n    g.fillStyle = grad;\n    g.fillRect(0, 0, 64, 64);\n    return s;\n  }\n  const glowAmber = makeGlow('rgba(255,190,110,1)');\n  const glowCoral = makeGlow('rgba(255,107,91,1)');\n\n  /* Graph state */\n  const nodes = [], edges = [], packets = [];\n  let anomaly = null;                 /* { node, t, phase } */\n  const mouse = { x: 0, y: 0 }, eased = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n\n  function dist(a, b){ const dx = a.x - b.x, dy = a.y - b.y; return Math.hypot(dx, dy); }\n\n  function buildGraph(){\n    nodes.length = 0; edges.length = 0; packets.length = 0; anomaly = null;\n    const count = W < 760 ? 30 : 50;\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++){\n      /* bias density to the right half where copy doesn't sit */\n      const bias = Math.pow(Math.random(), .65);\n      nodes.push({\n        x: (0.08 + bias * 0.9) * W,\n        y: (0.06 + Math.random() * 0.88) * H,\n        depth: 0.35 + Math.random() * 0.65,     /* parallax + size */\n        phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n        heat: 0                                  /* anomaly heat 0..1 */\n      });\n    }\n    /* connect each node to its 2 nearest neighbours */\n    const seen = new Set();\n    nodes.forEach((n, i) => {\n      const near = nodes.map((m, j) => ({ j, d: i === j ? Infinity : dist(n, m) }))\n                        .sort((a, b) => a.d - b.d).slice(0, 2);\n      near.forEach(({ j }) => {\n        const key = i < j ? i + '-' + j : j + '-' + i;\n        if (!seen.has(key)){ seen.add(key); edges.push({ a: i, b: j }); }\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  function spawnPacket(){\n    if (packets.length > (W < 760 ? 26 : 60)) return;\n    const e = edges[(Math.random() * edges.length) | 0];\n    packets.push({\n      e, t: 0,\n      speed: 0.25 + Math.random() * 0.55,\n      dir: Math.random() < 0.5 ? 1 : -1,\n      size: 0.5 + Math.random() * 0.7\n    });\n  }\n\n  function triggerAnomaly(){\n    const idx = (Math.random() * nodes.length) | 0;\n    anomaly = { node: nodes[idx], t: 0 };\n  }\n\n  function resize(){\n    W = window.innerWidth; H = window.innerHeight;\n    cv.width = W * DPR; cv.height = H * DPR;\n    cv.style.width = W + 'px'; cv.style.height = H + 'px';\n    ctx.setTransform(DPR, 0, 0, DPR, 0, 0);\n    buildGraph();\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n  resize();\n\n  window.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n    mouse.x = (e.clientX / W) * 2 - 1;\n    mouse.y = (e.clientY / H) * 2 - 1;\n  });\n\n  let last = performance.now(), packetTimer = 0, anomalyTimer = 4, running = true;\n  document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => { running = !document.hidden; if (running){ last = performance.now(); tick(last); } });\n\n  function px(n){ /* parallax-adjusted position */\n    return {\n      x: n.x + eased.x * 18 * n.depth,\n      y: n.y + eased.y * 12 * n.depth\n    };\n  }\n\n  function draw(now, dt){\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);\n    eased.x += (mouse.x - eased.x) * 0.04;\n    eased.y += (mouse.y - eased.y) * 0.04;\n\n    /* anomaly lifecycle: flare (0-1.2s) -> heal ring (1.2-2.4s) */\n    if (anomaly){\n      anomaly.t += dt;\n      const n = anomaly.node;\n      n.heat = anomaly.t < 1.2\n        ? Math.min(1, anomaly.t / 0.35)\n        : Math.max(0, 1 - (anomaly.t - 1.2) / 0.9);\n      if (anomaly.t > 2.6){ n.heat = 0; anomaly = null; }\n    }\n\n    /* edges */\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    for (const e of edges){\n      const a = px(nodes[e.a]), b = px(nodes[e.b]);\n      const heat = Math.max(nodes[e.a].heat, nodes[e.b].heat);\n      const d = (nodes[e.a].depth + nodes[e.b].depth) / 2;\n      ctx.strokeStyle = heat > 0.05\n        ? `rgba(255,107,91,${(.05 + .3 * heat) * d})`\n        : `rgba(255,190,110,${.07 * d})`;\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(a.x, a.y); ctx.lineTo(b.x, b.y); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    /* nodes */\n    for (const n of nodes){\n      const p = px(n);\n      const pulse = 0.75 + 0.25 * Math.sin(now * 0.0012 + n.phase);\n      const r = (1.2 + n.depth * 1.6) * pulse;\n      const g = 14 * n.depth * (1 + n.heat * 2.2);\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'lighter';\n      ctx.globalAlpha = (0.22 + 0.3 * n.depth) * pulse * (1 + n.heat);\n      ctx.drawImage(n.heat > 0.05 ? glowCoral : glowAmber, p.x - g, p.y - g, g * 2, g * 2);\n      ctx.globalAlpha = 1;\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'source-over';\n      ctx.fillStyle = n.heat > 0.05\n        ? `rgba(255,140,125,${.5 + .5 * n.heat})`\n        : `rgba(255,214,160,${.35 + .45 * n.depth})`;\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, r, 0, 7); ctx.fill();\n    }\n\n    /* heal ring */\n    if (anomaly && anomaly.t > 1.2){\n      const p = px(anomaly.node);\n      const k = (anomaly.t - 1.2) / 1.4;\n      ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255,190,110,${.5 * (1 - k)})`;\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1.2;\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, 8 + k * 70, 0, 7); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    /* packets */\n    ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'lighter';\n    for (let i = packets.length - 1; i >= 0; i--){\n      const pk = packets[i];\n      pk.t += dt * pk.speed;\n      if (pk.t >= 1){ packets.splice(i, 1); continue; }\n      const a = px(nodes[pk.e.a]), b = px(nodes[pk.e.b]);\n      const t = pk.dir === 1 ? pk.t : 1 - pk.t;\n      const x = a.x + (b.x - a.x) * t;\n      const y = a.y + (b.y - a.y) * t;\n      const fade = Math.sin(pk.t * Math.PI);\n      const heat = Math.max(nodes[pk.e.a].heat, nodes[pk.e.b].heat);\n      const g = 7 * pk.size;\n      ctx.globalAlpha = .85 * fade;\n      ctx.drawImage(heat > 0.05 ? glowCoral : glowAmber, x - g, y - g, g * 2, g * 2);\n    }\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 1;\n    ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'source-over';\n  }\n\n  function tick(now){\n    if (!running) return;\n    const dt = Math.min((now - last) / 1000, 0.05);\n    last = now;\n\n    packetTimer -= dt;\n    if (packetTimer <= 0){ spawnPacket(); packetTimer = 0.08 + Math.random() * 0.1; }\n    anomalyTimer -= dt;\n    if (anomalyTimer <= 0 && !anomaly){ triggerAnomaly(); anomalyTimer = 5 + Math.random() * 4; }\n\n    draw(now, dt);\n    if (!reduceMotion) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  /* one calm frame for reduced motion, full loop otherwise */\n  for (let i = 0; i < 18; i++) spawnPacket();\n  requestAnimationFrame(t => { last = t; tick(t); });\n\n  /* ================================================================\n     HEADLINE — phosphor decode: glyphs resolve into the words\n  ================================================================ */\n  const GLYPHS = '█▓▒░<>/\\\\|=+*#10';\n  const decodes = document.querySelectorAll('.decode');\n  decodes.forEach(el => { el.textContent = el.dataset.text.replace(/\\S/g, '\\u00A0'); el.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true'); });\n\n  function decode(el, delay, done){\n    const target = el.dataset.text;\n    if (reduceMotion){ el.textContent = target; if (done) done(); return; }\n    let frame = 0;\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      const iv = setInterval(() => {\n        frame++;\n        let out = '';\n        for (let i = 0; i < target.length; i++){\n          if (target[i] === ' '){ out += ' '; continue; }\n          const resolveAt = i * 2 + 4;\n          out += frame >= resolveAt ? target[i]\n               : GLYPHS[(Math.random() * GLYPHS.length) | 0];\n        }\n        el.textContent = out;\n        if (frame >= target.length * 2 + 4){ clearInterval(iv); if (done) done(); }\n      }, 28);\n    }, delay);\n  }\n\n  const caret = document.getElementById('caret');\n  decode(decodes[0], 300);\n  decode(decodes[1], 650);\n  decode(decodes[2], 1000, () => caret.classList.add('on'));\n  if (reduceMotion) caret.classList.add('on');\n\n  /* ================================================================\n     TELEMETRY SCOPE\n  ================================================================ */\n  /* tick ring */\n  const ticks = document.getElementById('ticks');\n  let tickHTML = '';\n  for (let i = 0; i < 60; i++){\n    const a = (i / 60) * Math.PI * 2;\n    const r1 = i % 5 === 0 ? 78 : 85, r2 = 91;\n    const c = i % 5 === 0 ? 'rgba(255,180,84,.9)' : 'rgba(242,237,226,.14)';\n    tickHTML += `<line x1=\"${100 + Math.cos(a) * r1}\" y1=\"${100 + Math.sin(a) * r1}\"\n                       x2=\"${100 + Math.cos(a) * r2}\" y2=\"${100 + Math.sin(a) * r2}\" stroke=\"${c}\"/>`;\n  }\n  ticks.innerHTML = tickHTML;\n\n  /* uptime count-up */\n  const uptimeEl = document.getElementById('uptime');\n  const t0 = performance.now();\n  (function countUp(now){\n    const k = Math.min((now - t0) / 1800, 1);\n    const e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - k, 4);\n    uptimeEl.textContent = (e * 99.99).toFixed(2);\n    if (k < 1 && !reduceMotion) requestAnimationFrame(countUp);\n    else uptimeEl.textContent = '99.99';\n  })(t0);\n\n  /* live ping + streams */\n  const pingEl = document.getElementById('ping');\n  const streamsEl = document.getElementById('streams');\n  let streams = 1024;\n  if (!reduceMotion) setInterval(() => {\n    pingEl.textContent = 6 + ((Math.random() * 7) | 0);\n    streams += ((Math.random() * 9) | 0) - 4;\n    streamsEl.textContent = streams.toLocaleString('en-US');\n  }, 1400);\n\n  /* P99 sparkline — scrolling phosphor trace */\n  const sp = document.getElementById('spark');\n  const sctx = sp.getContext('2d');\n  let sw = 0, sh = 0;\n  function sparkResize(){\n    sw = sp.clientWidth; sh = sp.clientHeight;\n    sp.width = sw * DPR; sp.height = sh * DPR;\n    sctx.setTransform(DPR, 0, 0, DPR, 0, 0);\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', sparkResize);\n  sparkResize();\n\n  const pts = [];\n  const MAXP = 90;\n  let spike = 0;\n  function sparkTick(){\n    if (spike <= 0 && Math.random() < 0.04) spike = 4 + Math.random() * 5;\n    let v = 0.25 + Math.random() * 0.12;\n    if (spike > 0){ v += spike * 0.07; spike--; }\n    pts.push(v);\n    if (pts.length > MAXP) pts.shift();\n\n    sctx.clearRect(0, 0, sw, sh);\n    /* baseline grid */\n    sctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(242,237,226,.06)';\n    sctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    sctx.beginPath(); sctx.moveTo(0, sh - 8); sctx.lineTo(sw, sh - 8); sctx.stroke();\n    /* trace, drawn twice: halo + core */\n    for (const pass of [[3, 'rgba(255,180,84,.18)'], [1.4, 'rgba(255,200,130,.95)']]){\n      sctx.lineWidth = pass[0]; sctx.strokeStyle = pass[1];\n      sctx.lineJoin = 'round';\n      sctx.beginPath();\n      pts.forEach((p, i) => {\n        const x = (i / (MAXP - 1)) * sw;\n        const y = sh - 8 - p * (sh - 14);\n        i === 0 ? sctx.moveTo(x, y) : sctx.lineTo(x, y);\n      });\n      sctx.stroke();\n    }\n  }\n  for (let i = 0; i < MAXP; i++) pts.push(0.25 + Math.random() * 0.12);\n  sparkTick();\n  if (!reduceMotion) setInterval(sparkTick, 120);\n\n  /* entrance */\n  const arm = () => requestAnimationFrame(() => document.body.classList.add('loaded'));\n  document.readyState === 'loading'\n    ? window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', arm)\n    : arm();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "axiom-observability-matrix.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/axiom-observability-matrix.jpg", "source_name": "axiom-observability-matrix-DESIGN.md", "views": 40, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T19:36:46.965951+00:00"}